		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>周围的电路板和导电材料 </grad><grad from=#E2683B to=#FFC0A8 f=0.8>动力手环</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Conductite 意味着 Trial Guardian 已被击败，而电路板正是 Railgun 的运行所需。</grad></shadow>"
