		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>掉落自 </grad><grad from=#E2683B to=#FFC0A8 f=0.8>大法师甘道夫</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>暗影巫师死后，甘道夫会独自出现，拥有 </grad><grad from=#E2683B to=#FFC0A8 f=0.8>2000 生命值</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，并且会带上加特曼。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "1538897B108B0B19"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1EBAB13B3EA31BB8"
				item: "terramity:malediction_bracelets"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -8.5d
			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Exodium、</grad><grad from=#E2683B to=#FFC0A8 f=0.8>Power Bracelets、</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和空白的 essence。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>空白的精华意味着你曾站在斯提克斯血中并幸存下来。为此，请佩戴</grad><grad from=#E2683B to=#FFC0A8 f=0.8>斯提克斯安全护身符</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
			]
