		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>掉落自 </grad><grad from=#E2683B to=#FFC0A8 f=0.8>地狱岩怪</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，一种拥有 </grad><grad from=#E2683B to=#FFC0A8 f=0.8>250点生命值</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 且会掉落怨念之魂的生物。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>比这个栏位里的任何 boss 掉落物都更容易刷取。</grad></shadow>"
